 roommate after first arriving in town to  work at caltech  he meets sheldon who quizzes him on  sci-fi trivia before allowing him to  enter  original series over next generation but  picard over kirk  correct you've passed the first barrier  to roommate hood  at this point the apartment features a  spare living room that  indicates an otherwise occupied mind  instead of the couches and chairs that  the main characters spend the majority  of their time gathered around  the layout is simply lawn chairs around  a card table when leonard enters his  future bedroom  he discovers that sheldon's former  roommate has painted die  sheldon dye on the wall as a parting  gift undeterred and in need of a room  leonard decides to stay he gets an early  glimpse of sheldon's temperament when  he's forced to sign an incredibly  detailed roommate agreement that will be  used to arbitrate many future disputes  this origin story leads penny to ask the  obvious question  why is leonard still living with sheldon  leonard reveals that despite sheldon's  cold demeanor he's frequently defended  his roommate from potentially harmful  situations  for example there was the time that they  discovered that leonard's former  girlfriend joyce kim was a north korean  spy attempting to get information about  an experimental rocket fuel that leonard  was developing  leonard could have easily been facing  treason charges but sheldon promised to  defend him should the government come  looking  there was also the time that leonard's  enthusiasm for his rocket fuel  experiments nearly turned deadly  egged on by howard and raj they  attempted to use his fuel in a rocket  that howard had built but leonard got  the proportions wrong and accidentally  created a bomb  sheldon then correctly calculated how  long they had before the fuel detonated  he pushed a panicking leonard away from  the mixture placed it in the building's  elevator and closed the door right  before it exploded  unquestionably saving leonard's life  sheldon promised to keep mom about the  cause of the destroyed  elevator which remained broken for  almost the entire series  sheldon's ability to protect his friends  and the multiple times that he kept  leonard from serious harm demonstrate  his true value as a roommate  leonard sheldon howard and raj all have  trouble deviating from their regimented  schedules  they've divided their weeks into a  routine of visits to the comic book  store  gaming nights and tv viewing parties but  this pattern is eventually broken up by  romantic interests  over the course of the series leonard's  life is shaken by his on-again off-again  relationship with penny  howard is reeled in and reformed by his  girlfriend and eventual wife bernadette  raj and sheldon meanwhile proved to be  tougher nuts to crack  raj is clinically terrified of women his  phobia is so intense that even though he  desperately wants to be in a  relationship  he loses the ability to speak in the  presence of any woman  he's eventually able to get over this  intense fear after he dates a  dermatologist named emily who proves to  have a particular taste for gory movies  they kind of turn me on and play  as with most parts of life sheldon is  the notably difficult to budge when it  comes to romance  his changes in the area are gradual and  hard-won  but they do indeed come thanks to the  efforts of amy farah fowler  she is remarkably similar to him and  probably the only person on the show who  can fully understand his worldview  she had previously avoided romantic  relationships her entire life to focus  on her work in neurobiology  sheldon did pretty much the same thing  but unlike sheldon  amy had always desired a romantic  partner so she turns her relentless  planning energy and desire for a  regimented schedule toward the concept  of marriage  sitcoms tend to depend on familiarity  and a slow sense of growth  as viewers come to love the characters  the big bang theory adhered to this  strategy 