cile and she's  able to pull him out from under the  thumb of his domineering mother and help  him become his own man  they go on to have a daughter and a son  and both of them realize their  professional goals  howard travels to space as an astronaut  while bernadette earns a phd in  microbiology  it's worth noting that among all the  main characters raj  is given the least to do considering how  the show develops characters through  relationships his perennially single  status leaves him nowhere near as much  room to change as everyone else  that doesn't mean he's entirely static  though for much of the series he suffers  from selective mutism  whenever he gets near women he loses the  ability to speak due to overwhelming  anxiety  his mutism can go away when he's drunk  or at least thinks that he's drunk  eventually he grows out of this  condition there's also occasional  speculation that raj  is gay thanks to his style of dress love  of women targeted entertainment  and constant close companionship with  howard weirdly enough  though he's often seen having more  success with women than howard  he's actually able to win over some  ladies via his uncomfortable silence  he almost ends up married in the final  season as the show finds him in a  relationship with a woman named anu  but that storyline comes to an end when  she's offered a job in london  and he opts to stay behind in los  angeles  throughout the series penny keeps the  other characters grounded  most of the other women are brought into  the show via their connections to penny  and the men become fully functioning  adults thanks in great part to her  frequent lessons about the real world  just like other characters penny also  matures as she settles into a  comfortable adulthood  she follows her friend bernadette into  the world of pharmaceuticals leaving  behind her precarious life as a waitress  and aspiring actress for the  solidly middle class existence of a  sales representative  the possibility of penny becoming a  mother bookends the series as she's  shown in a flashback at one point  fretting over a pregnancy test that test  way back when was negative which greatly  relieved her at the time  the accumulated changes in her life and  a much more stable existence are  reflected in the way that she reacts to  a similar situation  at the very end of the series well i  can't get more pregnant  we'll see about that the big bang theory  closes with quite a few conclusions and  at least one beginning  leonard and penny finished the show  celebrating a positive pregnancy test  ecstatic at the idea of being parents  raunch's romantic life is left up in the  air but it's implied that he's gone from  someone who couldn't even speak in the  presence of women  to someone who might now be dating a  world famous actress howard and  bernadette have been settled down in  marriage for a while so the finale more  or less just lets them be  amy and sheldon achieve their lifelong  goal of a nobel prize in physics  highlighting the way that it's always  been about the work for them however  after a big blow up with everyone else  over sheldon's incredible stubbornness  he delivers the most shocking moment of  the finale by realizing that there's  more to the world than himself  from the nobel ceremony stage he thanks  his family and then acknowledges his  friends for their incredible patience  i was under a misapprehension that my  accomplishments were mine alone  nothing could be further from the truth  though the big bang theory has come to  an end  fans can still get their fix as cbs has  continued to mine sheldon cooper for  ratings gold  in the form of the prequel series young  sheldon it focuses on sheldon's early  life with his family in texas  and don't be surprised if it ends up  sticking around just as long as its  predecessor  as it's been a top 10 ratings hit its  first three seasons  for anyone who wants to catch a glimpse  into how the big bang theory was made  and 